Two orthonormal unit vectors in $\ker A_{q_0}$ are

$$
k=\frac{13|0,\epsilon_0\rangle-16|2,\epsilon_1\rangle}{\sqrt{425}},
\qquad \ell=|2,\epsilon_2\rangle.
